  resource_type: tool
  link_status: active
  notes: >-
    Local-first note tool cited in source-systems.md as an example of
    stewardship + ongoing additions in plain files you own — stores notes as
    plain Markdown with bidirectional linking so the knowledge graph builds
    itself as you write. Recommended in the "Stretch" exercise for standing
    up a real source system.
